title: "Suborbital Arabidopsis: Cross-Mission Omics and Trajectory Modeling of Blue Origin NS-26"
abstract: "Re-analysis and multi-mission comparative transcriptomics of Arabidopsis thaliana seedlings during suborbital spaceflight on Blue Origin New Shepard NS-26, cross-referenced with Virgin Galactic Unity 22 (OSD-624) and orbital ISS baselines."
